  "file_title": "Degree-6 vertex with one undecided crease that no angle closes",
  "file_description": "The vertex at the centre of solve/failure_case.osf, minimised. One crease is unassigned (U); the other five are decided. No fold angle for that crease makes the vertex close — the closest gets within 65.96 degrees — so the pattern cannot be folded. Check foldability must name this vertex. Before implementation-plans/never-report-silence.md it reported nothing at all, because the fan declined on the unassigned crease and a declined fan produced no report.",
